 <div class="dmRespRow" id="1346363691"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1810234542"> <div class="dmRespCol large-12 medium-12 small-12" id="1181802246"> <div class="u_1466893729 dmRespRow" id="1466893729"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1566442924"> <div class="dmRespCol small-12 u_1260027993 large-3 medium-3" id="1260027993" data-anim-desktop="none"> <div class="u_1191866912 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1191866912" data-styletopreserve="{" background-image":""}"=""> <h4 style="letter-spacing: -0.05em;"><span style="text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color_6);display:unset;font-family:'Arial Black';">Sele&ccedil;&atilde;o&bull;2026</span></h4> 
</div> 
 <div class="u_1051662263 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1051662263" style="text-align: left; transition: none; display: block;"><p><span style="display: initial;">Nesta etapa, o programa BNDES Periferias Fortes Norte vai selecionar at&eacute; 82 organiza&ccedil;&otilde;es sociais perif&eacute;ricas. Para isso, vamos fazer diagn&oacute;sticos e entrevistas, al&eacute;m de uma banca para avaliar as OSPs inscritas no processo seletivo.</span></p></div> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmRespCol small-12 u_1227657874 large-3 medium-3" id="1227657874"> <div class="u_1176698042 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1176698042" style="transition: none; text-align: left; display: block;"> <h4 style="letter-spacing: -0.05em;"><span style="text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color_6);display:unset;font-family:'Arial Black';">Capacita&ccedil;&atilde;o&bull;2027</span></h4> 
</div> 
 <div class="u_1834076675 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1834076675" style="text-align: left; transition: none; display: block;"><p><span style="display: unset; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Nesta etapa, as organiza&ccedil;&otilde;es participar&atilde;o de capacita&ccedil;&otilde;es online sobre temas relacionados ao fortalecimento estrutural e institucional pelo Instituto Phomenta e pelo Instituto Phi. Os temas estar&atilde;o alinhados com a realidade das organiza&ccedil;&otilde;es.</span></p></div> 
</div> 
 <div class="u_1492741268 dmRespCol small-12 large-3 medium-3" id="1492741268" data-anim-desktop="none"> <div class="u_1568440501 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1568440501" style="transition: none; text-align: left; display: block;"> <h4 style="letter-spacing: -0.05em;"><span style="text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color_6);display:unset;font-family:'Arial Black';">Plano de Desenvolvimento Institucional &bull;2027</span></h4> 
</div> 
 <div class="u_1607396949 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1607396949" style="text-align: left;"><p><span style="display: unset;"><span style="display: unset;">Desenvolvimento de um plano com foco no fortalecimento da sua organiza&ccedil;&atilde;o, a partir de diagn&oacute;stico e da capacita&ccedil;&atilde;o. A OSP vai priorizar como utilizar&aacute; os recursos.</span> 
</span></p></div> 
</div> 
 <div class="u_1730305882 dmRespCol small-12 large-3 medium-3" id="1730305882"> <div class="u_1813714531 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1813714531" style="transition: none; text-align: left; display: block;"> <h4 class="m-size-16 size-20" style="letter-spacing: -0.05em;"><span class="font-size-20 m-font-size-16" style="text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color_6);display:unset;font-family:'Arial Black';">Acompanhamento e Implementa&ccedil;&atilde;o&bull;2028</span></h4> 
</div> 
 <div class="u_1321521146 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1321521146" style="text-align: left; display: block; transition: none;"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); display: unset;">Nesta fase os recursos ser&atilde;o liberados de forma acompanhada, com o Instituto Phi, de acordo com o plano de desenvolvimento institucional criado pela sua organiza&ccedil;&atilde;o.</span></p></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
